\"text\", \"q\": \"To estimate variant proportions for the most recent 3 weeks, nowcasts were generated using multinomial regression fit on the previous 21 weeks of data\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Doubling times for proportions of specific lineages were estimated from the coefficients of the multinomial nowcasting model\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"All methods included weighting to account for the complex survey design and adjust for potential sampling biases\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"weights based on the weekly estimated number of infections represented by each SARS-CoV-2 sequence\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Each submitting laboratory source was considered a primary sampling unit, and the state and week of sequence sample collection were considered strata\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Biweekly estimates using the updated model were compared with weekly estimates from the previous model to assess consistency\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}